<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>GENOA, Nov 12 - one bulk carrier and two tankers awaiting berths, average berthing delay one to two days.</p>
<p>SAVONA, Nov 12 - one vessel waiting for normal berth, average berthing delay 12 to 24 hours. Three vessels awaiting special berth.</p>
</text>
